<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>Brian Billion – Financial Programs</title>

<style>
  @page {
    margin: 40px;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "Poppins", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* Cover Page */
  .cover {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 160px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #000000, #1c1c1c);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .cover h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .cover h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #d4af37;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }

  .cover .frame {
    position: absolute;
    top: 40px;
    left: 40px;
    right: 40px;
    bottom: 40px;
    border: 3px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  /* Sections */
  section {
    margin: 50px auto;
    max-width: 850px;
    padding: 0 10px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #000;
    border-left: 6px solid #d4af37;
    padding-left: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p {
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  ul li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #333;
  }

  .box {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    border-left: 6px solid #d4af37;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 25px 0;
  }

  /* Call to Action */
  .cta {
    margin: 60px auto;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #d4af37, #f3e7b2);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .cta h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .cta p {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- COVER PAGE -->
<div class="cover">
  <div class="frame"></div>
  <h1>Brian Billion</h1>
  <h2>Financial Literacy Programs</h2>
</div>

<!-- INTRODUCTION -->
<section>
  <h2>Welcome Message</h2>
  <p>
    Welcome to <strong>Brian Billion’s Financial Literacy Programs</strong> — a practical and empowering 
    learning experience designed to equip youth, business owners, and individuals with the tools 
    and mindset needed to build long-term financial success.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- PROGRAM OVERVIEW -->
<section>
  <h2>Program Overview</h2>
  <p>
    These programs simplify complex financial concepts into clear, actionable steps. Whether 
    you’re starting your financial journey or looking to elevate your wealth-building knowledge, 
    this curriculum guides you through the essential foundations of money mastery.
  </p>

  <div class="box">
    <strong>Core Focus Areas:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Budgeting & Money Discipline</li>
      <li>Smart Saving Systems</li>
      <li>Debt Freedom Strategies</li>
      <li>Investment Fundamentals</li>
      <li>Wealth Mindset & Habits</li>
      <li>Entrepreneur Finance for SMEs</li>
      <li>Digital Finance Essentials</li>
      <li>Personal Growth for Financial Success</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROGRAM STRUCTURE -->
<section>
  <h2>Program Structure</h2>
  <p>The training is delivered through:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Workshops & Masterclasses</li>
    <li>Youth Talks & Summits</li>
    <li>Business Community Trainings</li>
    <li>Online Courses & Virtual Sessions</li>
    <li>Personal Financial Coaching</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- WHO IT’S FOR -->
<section>
  <h2>Who These Programs Are For</h2>
  <p>This curriculum is ideal for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Young adults seeking financial direction</li>
    <li>SME owners managing cash flow and growth</li>
    <li>Individuals new to financial literacy</li>
    <li>People ready for financial transformation</li>
    <li>Organizations empowering youth or communities</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- BENEFITS -->
<section>
  <h2>Benefits & Outcomes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Master the fundamentals of money management</li>
    <li>Build strong financial discipline and habits</li>
    <li>Understand saving, investing, and budgeting</li>
    <li>Develop a wealth-oriented mindset</li>
    <li>Improve financial confidence and decision-making</li>
    <li>Strengthen business and personal financial skills</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta">
  <h3>Ready to Transform Your Financial Future?</h3>
  <p>Book a session, request a program, or partner with Brian Billion today.</p>
</section>

</body>
</html>
